I partnered with the OneRisk team to address query performance that was affecting their data-loading pipelines. I designed and implemented a service that lets OneRisk retrieve calculated MRV results directly from Databricks using Metric Views. This enabled OneRisk to complete its data loads within the agreed SLA and reduced demand on the shared CubIQ Power BI semantic model.

I aligned CubIQ semantic model delivery with UBS release practices by maintaining the model in TMDL and establishing a CI/CD process for deploying changes to production. I also created reusable query templates and a shared reconciliation dashboard so colleagues could review discrepancies across data layers and use the same evidence to verify fixes.

I shared practical lessons from the HVE Core evaluation with more than 50 Marvel developers. I demonstrated the research, planning, and implementation workflow and validated a repeatable GitLab and DevPod setup that colleagues can use to try it in their own workspaces during the pilot.
